    "name": "The Bazaar Hotel Bangkok – MRT Lat Phrao Ratchadapisek",
    "detail": "Overall experience was very good. The hotel was brand new with beautiful rooms and lobby. The staffs are courteous and willing to serve. I booked 2 rooms during this stay. My 2 key selection criteria were the price/value with included breakfast and the location near a MRT station. However only one of the two criteria was met during this stay. The hotel was so new that the restaurant was not ready to serve breakfast. However the staffs were very apologetic and offered room upgrades to compensate for the missing breakfast. If the price/value of the hotel continues including serving breakfast, I will not hesitate to book this hotel again on my next trip to Bangkok.",
